flowchart TD
    start((Start)) --> boot[FastAPI startup]
    boot --> parse[Load menu.docx\nand parse one chunk per item]
    parse --> index{FAISS index\nfresh vs menu.docx?}
    index -->|No| embed[Embed each chunk with\ntext-embedding-3-small\nand save FAISS]
    index -->|Yes| loadidx[Load saved FAISS]
    embed --> ready[App ready]
    loadidx --> ready

    ready --> ask[Receive POST /ask\nJSON: question]
    ask --> qembed[Embed the question\nsame embedding model]
    qembed --> search[FAISS similarity search\ntop 5 item chunks]
    search --> prompt[Fill ChatPromptTemplate\nsystem.txt + human.txt\ncontext + question]
    prompt --> llm[ChatOpenAI gpt-4o-mini]
    llm --> resp[Return JSON\nanswer]
    resp --> stop((End))
